# 02 — Tech Stack: Conventions & Patterns

## Stack Overview
| Layer | Technology | Version |
|---|---|---|
| Framework | Astro | Latest stable (check `package.json`) |
| Language | TypeScript | Strict mode (`"strict": true` in tsconfig) |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS | v3 |
| Database | Supabase (PostgreSQL) | Free tier |
| Auth | Supabase Auth (Google OAuth) | Free tier |
| Storage | Supabase Storage | Free tier (1GB limit) |
| Hosting | Cloudflare Pages | Free tier |
| Domain | Hostinger DNS | Already owned |

