## Astro Rendering Strategy
| Content Type | Strategy | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Blog posts | SSG (`getStaticPaths`) | Static = $0 bandwidth, fast |
| Notes (public) | SSG | Same as blog |
| Projects page | SSG | Rarely changes |
| Homepage | SSG | Fast, free |
| Games | Client-side only (island) | No server needed |
| Profile page | SSR (`output: 'server'`) | Needs auth context |
| Notes (private) | SSR | Needs user session |
| Bookmarks | SSR | Needs user session |
| Scores | SSR or CSR | Supabase client-side call OK |

> **Default to SSG.** Only use SSR when user-specific data is required on page load.
> **Prefer CSR (Astro Islands)** for interactive features that don't need SEO.

